+    // fishpond patch 24: Yusri paid Mystic Remora's cumulative upkeep for 5 turns (1+2+3+4+5 mana on 3-5 lands) and never
+    // cast its 3-mana commander (varied pods V09 game 4). Pay a cumulative upkeep's mana only while it leaves the mana to
